<text x="2" y="98" size="1.8" layer="21" ratio="12">Powerline Bridge rev A — 160 x 100 mm, 2 layers, 1.6 mm FR-4</text>
<text x="2" y="95.5" size="1.2" layer="21" ratio="12">MAINS: L → F1 → PS1.1 and U2.16/17 ; N → PS1.2 and U2.15 ; MOV1 after F1</text>
<text x="66" y="98" size="1.4" layer="21" ratio="12">HAZARDOUS VOLTAGE — 8.0 mm creepage / 6.5 mm clearance to all SELV copper</text>
<text x="66" y="95.5" size="1.2" layer="21" ratio="12">Creepage figure from PLC Stamp mini 2 datasheet §8.3 (4000 Vac isolation)</text>
<text x="2" y="20" size="1.2" layer="21" ratio="12">U2 pads 15/16/17 are mains: keep this corner free of every other pad</text>
<text x="92" y="4" size="1.2" layer="21" ratio="12">U3 antenna end (+Y) — no copper, no enclosure wall within 10 mm</text>
<text x="126" y="12" size="1.2" layer="21" ratio="12">U4 RJ45 nose overhangs the right edge</text>
